  "instance_name": "nike_brand_cultural_significance",
  "label": "Nike Brand Cultural Significance",
  "description": "Nike is a global sportswear brand that has become a cultural icon, often associated with athleticism, streetwear, and youth culture. Wearing a Nike logo, especially in a bold, oversized way as seen in the image, can signal a connection to global fashion trends and urban style. The background knowledge needed to understand the meme is that Nike is not just a clothing brand but a symbol of modern, accessible, and aspirational fashion, often embraced by diverse communities including Muslim women who are redefining style through global brands.",
